## SSL и домен

### DNS записи

```
A     erman.ai      → {server_ip}
A     www.erman.ai  → {server_ip}
```

### ssl-init.sh

```bash
#!/bin/bash
set -e

source .env

DOMAIN="${DOMAIN:-erman.ai}"
EMAIL="${CERTBOT_EMAIL:-hello@erman.ai}"

echo "=== Requesting SSL certificate for $DOMAIN ==="

# Остановить nginx чтобы освободить :80
docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.prod.yml stop nginx

# Запросить сертификат
certbot certonly --standalone \
  -d "$DOMAIN" \
  -d "www.$DOMAIN" \
  --email "$EMAIL" \
  --agree-tos \
  --no-eff-email \
  --non-interactive

# Скопировать в nginx/ssl/
mkdir -p nginx/ssl
cp /etc/letsencrypt/live/$DOMAIN/fullchain.pem nginx/ssl/fullchain.pem
cp /etc/letsencrypt/live/$DOMAIN/privkey.pem nginx/ssl/privkey.pem

# Запустить nginx
docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.prod.yml start nginx

echo "=== SSL configured! Now uncomment HTTPS block in nginx/conf.d/default.conf ==="
```

### ssl-deploy-hook.sh (для автопродления)

```bash
#!/bin/bash
source /opt/erman-ai/.env
DOMAIN="${DOMAIN:-erman.ai}"
cp /etc/letsencrypt/live/$DOMAIN/fullchain.pem /opt/erman-ai/nginx/ssl/fullchain.pem
cp /etc/letsencrypt/live/$DOMAIN/privkey.pem /opt/erman-ai/nginx/ssl/privkey.pem
docker compose -f /opt/erman-ai/docker-compose.yml \
  -f /opt/erman-ai/docker-compose.prod.yml \
  exec nginx nginx -s reload
```

Cron:
```bash
0 3 * * * certbot renew --quiet --deploy-hook "/opt/erman-ai/scripts/ssl-deploy-hook.sh" \
  >> /var/log/certbot-renew.log 2>&1
```

